                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Whatever the reviews are shooting up are either pure jerking off the cock of the most banal yet braindead retarded devteam I have ever encountered. This game is not a game. It is a rigid puzzle with explicit features. There is no resource management, there is not actual \"train\" gameplay there is only building track and praying your train leaves the station before 6 months has passed.\n\nThe dev team decided to go with semi-realism insofar as tax is brutal and annual but a train takes 4 FUCKING YEARS TO GET TO A STATION THIS IS A FUNDAMENTAL FLAW THAT ANY HALF ASSED GAME CAN FUCKING DEAL WITH. BOOST YOUR INCREMENTALS OR FIND SOMETHING ELSE. The tax pays out randomly as well. It will occaisionally bankrupt you in the middle of june because???????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????\n\nThere's no way to win and getting full stars in each level BECAUSE THIS IS BASICALLY A FUCKING LOW VALUE MOBILE GAME LEVEL OF SOURCESIM is entirely up to fucking rng. The game may spawn your selected starting railways with a 60000 dollar monument and nearly 30000 dollars worth of tree removal on a single line and the goals are make 300000, dont crash, and dont remove landscape over 10000. \n\n\nThe gameplay is fine. It has a grind feeling that plays similar to factorio or playing with the old wooden train sets. It's 1% building tracks, 20% flipping switches and 79% getting absolutely raped by mechanics entirely outside your control. Need a track to send the ONLY available job to a station?\n\nWrong, you fail.\n\nDidn't get the final caboose into the station between july and december?\nFAIL\n\nHad a single mishap and need to reverse your train?\n\nWhat are you trying to do play the game with the mechanics included?\nFucking stupid pissbrain faggot thats a FAIL.\n\nThe game will bankrupt you with a train docking in the station because the coders for the game used rocks to smash their penises against the screen and used the blood scrawl as a manual. This means unless you have a train going at all times you will fail.\n\nYou cannot have a train going at all times. Some of the railways are sending to a place with a job sending back, building the infrastructure for that BANKRUPTS YOU\n\nI would say here \"its a puzzle game so it makes sense\" BUT ITS NOT A PUZZLE GAME.  A PUZZLE GAME REQUIRES TACTICS AND STRATEGY, THIS GAME PUNISHES THAT, ITS NOT A RESOURCE SIM OR A TRAIN MANAGER OR FUCKING ANYTHING IT'S A PLAY WITH TRAINS THAT LOCKS THE ENTIRE SANDBOX BEHIND A BROKEN, UNPOLISHED, POORLY CODED, AWFULLY BUILT, AND COMPLETELY RAGE INDUCING \"STORY\" MODE. \n\nI got this in a G2A bundle and I still feel fucking ripped off.\n\nI can't fathom how theres a second one when this one was so beyond god awful to slog through.",
